                                                "sense_id": "448bac79-be1a-362d-8478-82581c21f57d",
                                                "text": "Increasingly it is being realised that a modern conurbation's transport problems cannot be solved if there is a fixation on profit and loss in public transport—[...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "63514eb2-88a1-316a-b67c-76919076608b",
